"""Rebuilds the Book Club page to the new design (welcome and membership cards, Come Read, The Shelf year tiles, the genres as books on a bookshelf).

Run it from the project folder, AFTER unzipping starscapes-book-club-19oct.zip into it:   python3 tools/add-book-club-v3.py

What it does: it makes exact edits to three files that already exist (the Book Club page, its words and its styles).
  src/bookclub/BookClubPage.jsx, src/bookclub/bookClubData.js, src/bookclub/bookclub.css

How it keeps you safe:
  - It checks ALL three files first. If any is not exactly the way it expects, it changes NOTHING and says which.
  - Before changing a file it keeps a copy, ending .before-book-club-v3.
  - It is safe to run twice: a file already done is left alone.
  - The new files () come in the zip itself.
"""
